  "readableHtml": "\r\n\r\n <div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div></div>\r\n\t\t<div><a href=\"https://w2i.wanmei.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"assets/57b9674c5c01d917be6e.gif\" alt=\"完美国际\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\r\n        \r\n\t\t<div><p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200905/ectype/iframe/top.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200905/ectype/iframe/top.htm</a></p></div>\r\n\t<div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200905/ectype/iframe/left_menu.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200905/ectype/iframe/left_menu.htm</a></p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t<dl>\r\n\t\t\t<dd>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><a href=\"#page=33cb0d9652b4b915ca2a\"><img src=\"assets/52369d6719fcba5f9f06.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><a href=\"#page=4dd65a60c7a2c6a80e3c\"><img src=\"assets/019cc39ea74d293367a4.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><a href=\"#page=99187cea065b9a3bc13f\"><img src=\"assets/118a9c381b56ed198c0a.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><a href=\"#page=e27e5d58ee71ef14e0c1\"><img src=\"assets/d3450ebb69491c0bf930.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><a href=\"#page=6d2b5b18c1c6f6f3a0e8\"><img src=\"assets/03db8e7dd8416a39988d.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>　　本阶段须由队伍共同完成数个任务，完成后会奖励一枚妙计锦囊。</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>　　如果队长在开启任务时选择直接去守护幻界运转之地，则可直接跳过该阶段，直接进入第二阶段。</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>　　1.找到水昭然，与其对话，将会出现血罗王的化身，杀死这个化身将其掉落的碧黄髓交给水昭然。</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>　　2.水昭然告诉你，她的弟子灼星正处于危险之中，赶到灼星处，与其对话并杀死所有来犯的怨灵。</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>　　3.回到金棂子处，将得到其奖励的锦囊1枚，完成任务后第二阶段开始。</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><b>任务奖励</b></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<table>\r\n\t<tr>\r\n    \t<td><img src=\"assets/2f93e3751e9efbaaccd3.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\r\n        <td> </td>\r\n        <td><img src=\"assets/f721fac1a357265c5135.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>注意：在此阶段内必须保证队长在线且不能离队或转移队长，否则任务将会失败。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</dd>\r\n\t\t\t</dl>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n \r\n\r\n</div>\r\n",
